# api-exam-components

Each component has its own `description_en` and `description_bn`. Those fields are not the module description and are not shared between the MCQ component and the written component.

MCQ lifecycle `ACTIVE` and `ENDED` come from `Instant.now()` against the stored window. Do not add a route that sets those states by hand.

`combinedMaxMarks` is the sum of attached question marks on both components, and it appears only when both component rows exist. Do not store a weight.

A paper stores `passPercent` from 0 through 100. Scheduling an MCQ, and saving a written deadline, requires it. Do not put the percent on a section.

Do not start an attempt or accept an upload in this stage.
